dialogs
0	Though I fell to you, I will remain devoted to BIRD POKéMON.
1	A TRAINER has to be smart to keep up with unexpected turns of events.Do you have the smarts to get to our LEADER?
2	WINONA is cute and she's strong. She's the ultimate LEADER!Blush…
3	Thanks to WINONA, the people of FORTREE can live without fear.
4	The world is huge, and there are countless tough TRAINERS.I'm going to keep training and make myself even stronger.
5	Yo, how's it going, CHAMPION- bound PLAYER?FORTREE GYM LEADER WINONA is a master of FLYING-type POKéMON.She's waiting at the back of this GYM, behind the rotating doors.She's waiting for new challengers who are trying to take wing!Okay, go for it!
